<title>USA: Acceptance Insurance Cos Inc Q3 profit.</title>
<headline>Acceptance Insurance Cos Inc Q3 profit.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				   Three Months	Nine Months</p>
<p>			 1996	   1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Net premiums     122,167	  94,260     288,325    219,381</p>
<p>Insurance premiums</p>
<p>    earned	 121,374	  90,373     265,774    204,062</p>
<p>Net investment</p>
<p>   income	    6,588	   5,407	19,580     14,645</p>
<p>Net realized capital</p>
<p>   gains		 808	     779	 3,575	1,812</p>
<p>Revenues	   128,853	  97,133     289,934    222,735</p>
<p>Insurance losses and loss adjustment</p>
<p>   expenses	 73,863	  85,744     174,985    164,863</p>
<p>Operating profit</p>
<p>    (loss)	  27,269	 (8,838)	40,149     (1,063)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) 17,318	 (5,961)	24,821     (1,479)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share:</p>
<p>   Primary	   1.14	   (.40)	  1.64	 (.10)</p>
<p>   Fully diluted   1.12	   (.40)	  1.61	 (.10)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1995 includes $11.3 million after-tax charge to earnings to strengthen prior year loss reserves.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
